I take a deep breath.
I start to make my second coffee.
I had made mistakes in the first coffee.
This time I pay more attention to the steam wand.
I hold the milk jug correctly.
I am learning to froth the milk well.
I turn on the steam wand.
Now the milk has frothed up nicely.
I carefully pour that milk into the cup.
Jessy looks at the coffee.
She has liked it.
"This has turned out very well, Maya," Jessy says.
I feel very happy.
I have made a good coffee!
I am slowly learning to use this machine.
Today I feel very proud.
